<h1>SelRect</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p class="description"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> Selects all visible points and whole visible entities that are inside a rectangle.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Parameters</b></span>:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Xmin</b> – minimum X range of the rectangle related to the viewport.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Xmax</b> – maximum X range of the rectangle related to the viewport.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Ymin</b> – minimum Y range of the rectangle related to the viewport.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Ymax</b> – maximum Y range of the rectangle related to the viewport.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><i style="font-style:italic;">SelType</i></b> – how will the selection behave. Available options are:</p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><i style="font-style:italic;">Repl</i> – the new selection will replace any other selections.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><i style="font-style:italic;">Incl</i> – the new selection will be added to the current selection.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><i style="font-style:italic;">Excl</i> – the new selection will be subtracted from the current selection within its range.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>UI Commands</b></span>:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><i style="font-style:italic;">Select &gt; Region &gt; Rectangle</i> from the main menu. <i>Rectangular selection</i> button on the toolbar <img src="../Images/Image22.gif" width="24px" height="24px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt="">.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">&#160;</p>
<p class="Note" id="P1"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note</b></span>: Holding Ctrl key while drawing the selection will set Incl for SelType parameter. Holding Alt key while drawing the selection will set Excl for SelType parameter.</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">&#160;</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">Example:</p>
<p class="ExampleCode"><font style="font-family:Courier New;" face="Courier New">SelRect( Xmin=3.13743, Xmax=6.99327, Ymin=14.43706, Ymax=16.17744, SelType="Repl" )</font></p>
<p>&#160;</p>
